WEBVTT

00:05.020 --> 00:06.970
Here comes another psychic.

00:06.970 --> 00:10.010
What should we do with them, Dimple-san?

00:10.760 --> 00:12.860
Probably just another fake.

00:13.180 --> 00:14.270
Get 'em to scram.

00:19.300 --> 00:20.270
Oh, shit...

00:20.270 --> 00:21.000
He's...

00:22.550 --> 00:24.000
the real deal!

01:47.290 --> 01:52.130
Mob Psycho

01:57.010 --> 02:02.010
Inside
~Evil Spirit~

02:02.400 --> 02:03.970
This job we just got is huge!

02:04.970 --> 02:09.190
Cup Curry

02:05.150 --> 02:06.930
I still don't know the details,

02:06.930 --> 02:09.190
but the client is a famously wealthy fellow.

02:09.400 --> 02:11.850
We're talking super rich.

02:12.690 --> 02:14.700
He'll even pay for our taxi.

02:14.700 --> 02:17.340
And yet we're taking a train?

02:19.620 --> 02:22.910
So is this rich person the president
of a company or something?

02:22.910 --> 02:24.330
He is.

02:27.530 --> 02:30.410
How can one person own a house like this?

02:34.770 --> 02:38.340
Get a load of all these shady-looking people.

02:38.550 --> 02:40.300
They're probably from the same field.

02:40.680 --> 02:42.800
Hey, you two.

02:43.380 --> 02:45.140
Shinra Banshomaru-san.

02:45.530 --> 02:47.830
What the heck are you doing here?

02:47.830 --> 02:49.600
Right back at you.

02:49.600 --> 02:51.060
Shinra-kun.

02:51.630 --> 02:53.200
Jodo-sama!

02:52.600 --> 02:56.900
Jodo Kirin
Rising Sun Spiritual Union President

02:53.200 --> 02:56.280
Who is that man?

02:57.440 --> 03:00.120
He helped me with getting
rid of an evil spirit once.

03:00.120 --> 03:03.120
This is Reigen Arataka, a freelance psychic.

03:03.660 --> 03:05.970
Ah, so this is the man...

03:05.970 --> 03:11.190
The one who's been lying about
getting rid of the Dragger?

03:11.190 --> 03:12.460
Pleased to meet ya.

03:12.670 --> 03:14.160
So that's Jodo?

03:14.160 --> 03:15.270
Avoid eye contact!

03:15.270 --> 03:16.920
What a creepy geezer!

03:18.530 --> 03:19.510
It's them!

03:19.510 --> 03:24.600
Having a rough time trying
\h\hto get into the psychic biz\h\h

03:19.550 --> 03:24.600
Former Upper Echelon Member of
\h\h\h\h\h\h\hClaw's Seventh Division
Matsuo

03:20.230 --> 03:24.600
Are they going to get in my way again?
But I'm running a legit business now!

03:25.070 --> 03:25.870
Here he comes.

03:25.870 --> 03:26.810
It's the client.

03:27.530 --> 03:31.160
I thank all of you professionals
for gathering here today.

03:31.350 --> 03:37.780
Asagiri Holdings (Ltd.) CEO
Asagiri Masashi

03:32.080 --> 03:37.780
I have no doubts that you
are all true psychics.

03:38.450 --> 03:43.220
But whether any of you can save my daughter
is a different matter entirely.

03:44.140 --> 03:47.440
I ask that you keep what
you're about to see a secret.

03:47.960 --> 03:52.030
This is my daughter, Asagiri Minori.
She's fourteen years old.

03:52.030 --> 03:55.750
She is behind a one-way mirror,
so she cannot see us.

03:56.310 --> 03:58.210
She's the same age as Mob.

03:56.510 --> 03:58.210
He has her locked up?

03:58.450 --> 04:00.670
Isn't that going too far?

04:01.160 --> 04:05.390
At first, I didn't believe in spirits, either.

04:06.020 --> 04:11.790
But no matter how many counselors or
mental health professionals we saw,

04:11.790 --> 04:13.060
there was no improvement.

04:13.580 --> 04:17.400
She's been possessed by an evil spirit.

04:17.400 --> 04:21.030
I'd like for you all to rid her of it.

04:21.290 --> 04:22.240
What do you think?

04:22.690 --> 04:25.760
Right now, I'm not sensing anything.

04:25.760 --> 04:29.480
It's probably some mental disorder
stemming from adolescence.

04:29.480 --> 04:33.370
I do sense a faint sinister
presence though...

04:33.850 --> 04:35.830
And extremely nearby.

04:36.020 --> 04:37.820
No price is too high!

04:37.820 --> 04:41.790
I will have a special reward
for whoever saves my daughter!

04:42.630 --> 04:43.630
Very well.

04:43.900 --> 04:48.150
Guess we'll take care of this
in a jiffy once again.

04:48.150 --> 04:51.100
What do you say, Mob?
I'll be sure to give you a bonus.

04:51.680 --> 04:54.240
A bonus... That's a first.

04:54.240 --> 04:56.480
You've been underpaid this whole time.

04:56.630 --> 04:59.230
Hold it! You're not going
to steal the march on us!

04:59.230 --> 05:02.190
Namu

04:59.230 --> 05:02.190
Namu

04:59.560 --> 05:00.920
Who said you could decide?!

05:00.920 --> 05:02.190
No fair!

05:01.190 --> 05:02.190
Let me do it!

05:02.360 --> 05:04.680
Everyone, please, calm down.

05:04.680 --> 05:06.910
How about we do
rock-paper-scissors to decide?

05:07.550 --> 05:10.170
Huh? Rock-paper-scissors?

05:10.530 --> 05:12.170
I guess that's fair.

05:12.170 --> 05:12.900
Sure.

05:12.900 --> 05:13.500
Yeah.

05:13.820 --> 05:16.420
All right, I'm gonna throw paper.

05:16.420 --> 05:17.090
Huh?

05:17.090 --> 05:18.800
Why are you telling us that?

05:18.800 --> 05:20.330
Actually, I think I'll go with scissors.

05:20.330 --> 05:21.590
Uh, no, really...

05:22.100 --> 05:24.300
Leave him be. That's just how he is.

05:24.560 --> 05:26.870
So is he going to throw paper or scissors?

05:27.300 --> 05:29.320
First comes rock!

05:29.320 --> 05:30.760
Rock, paper,

05:30.760 --> 05:32.070
scissors!

05:32.070 --> 05:34.120
Reigen emerged victorious.

05:34.120 --> 05:36.440
Wow, how did you do that?

05:36.440 --> 05:40.400
Psychological Warfare

05:36.440 --> 05:40.400
Observation

05:36.440 --> 05:40.400
Line of Sight

05:36.440 --> 05:40.400
Their Hand Angles

05:36.440 --> 05:40.400
Scan their arms

05:36.440 --> 05:40.400
Etc.

05:36.740 --> 05:40.030
I will never lose to anyone
in rock-paper-scissors.

05:41.610 --> 05:42.980
See ya, losers.

05:43.540 --> 05:46.280
I never should've said I knew him.

05:46.990 --> 05:49.490
Please save my daughter.

05:49.490 --> 05:50.350
I've got it.

05:51.300 --> 05:55.650
I can't provide the professional help she needs.
Not on our first meeting, at that.

05:56.530 --> 06:00.880
All I can do here is
approach this as a psychic.

06:01.190 --> 06:02.440
Hello there.

06:02.890 --> 06:05.340
Yes, like I always do.

06:08.420 --> 06:11.280
Do you know why you're locked in here?

06:12.400 --> 06:14.690
I don't...

06:15.650 --> 06:18.210
There's something wrong with Papa lately.

06:18.210 --> 06:19.600
With your father?

06:19.830 --> 06:24.570
Lately, he's locked me up in here,
strapped me down onto this bed,

06:24.760 --> 06:27.860
started glaring at me,
and even hit me sometimes.

06:27.860 --> 06:31.030
That's not—I mean,
I didn't hit her hard...

06:32.560 --> 06:34.620
He's even brought around a bunch of adults

06:35.260 --> 06:38.750
and had them touch me all over
with their filthy, filthy hands.

06:38.750 --> 06:41.040
Th-That's preposterous!

06:41.440 --> 06:43.250
You can't believe a word Dad says.

06:43.940 --> 06:48.190
He's been acting so darn crazy lately,
like he's possessed.

06:48.190 --> 06:49.460
How so?

06:49.460 --> 06:51.480
He started saying that I've been cursed,

06:51.480 --> 06:54.220
or that my body's been taken over by a demon.

06:54.650 --> 06:57.850
I mean, I guess I was acting
a little rebellious,

06:57.850 --> 07:00.190
but this is going way too far.

07:00.190 --> 07:02.290
I-I assure you that I'm sane!

07:02.290 --> 07:03.520
This is ridiculous!

07:03.520 --> 07:06.320
There's a demon that's making
my daughter say these lies!

07:07.080 --> 07:10.780
Am I going to be trapped in here forever?

07:12.610 --> 07:14.410
Say, Mr. Psychic...

07:15.140 --> 07:17.560
could ya undo these for me?

07:17.560 --> 07:19.370
They hurt so bad!

07:20.190 --> 07:22.270
I'll ask your dad.

07:23.680 --> 07:24.740
How'd it go?

07:26.100 --> 07:27.840
This is an open-and-shut case.

07:28.330 --> 07:30.510
She is perfectly normal.

07:30.890 --> 07:33.030
You think so too, Jodo-sama?

07:33.030 --> 07:35.310
What? What do you mean?

07:35.310 --> 07:39.070
We're saying that there's zero
possibility that she's possessed.

07:39.070 --> 07:41.730
No, that can't be true!

07:41.730 --> 07:46.300
It's my turn next.
But I'm rather certain Jodo-sama is correct.

07:46.300 --> 07:47.190
But wait—

07:47.190 --> 07:49.450
Are you sure you're not the problem here?

07:50.180 --> 07:53.700
You don't like the change in your
relationship and refuse to accept it.

07:53.700 --> 07:56.490
Instead, you're blaming spirits and demons.

07:56.820 --> 07:59.240
N-No...

07:59.520 --> 08:02.140
Is that really how you guys
talk to a client?

08:02.140 --> 08:04.280
That's a nasty one.

08:04.280 --> 08:06.200
Definitely something wrong there.

08:06.200 --> 08:08.910
It didn't feel like I was
talking to a child.

08:09.630 --> 08:11.830
So you believe me?

08:11.830 --> 08:15.010
You just want the reward money
all to yourself, don't you?

08:15.320 --> 08:18.510
Everyone who actually fell for
what she said should leave now.

08:18.880 --> 08:20.520
She's just going to make a fool of you.

08:21.130 --> 08:23.270
The way she talked was too inconsistent.

08:23.690 --> 08:26.430
And she switched from "Papa" to "Dad."

08:27.030 --> 08:30.270
Also, I never introduced myself,

08:30.270 --> 08:32.700
but she called me a psychic.

08:33.000 --> 08:35.820
Meaning she heard our conversation out h—

08:40.940 --> 08:42.930
Udo! Are you all right?!

08:42.930 --> 08:43.950
Get a hold of yourself!

08:42.930 --> 08:45.270
Sh-She's a monster...

08:45.710 --> 08:46.760
Master!

08:46.760 --> 08:48.310
I'm fine.

08:48.930 --> 08:52.890
More importantly, she sure showed
her true colors pretty fast.

08:54.140 --> 08:56.440
I guess there's no point in
continuing this charade.

08:56.850 --> 08:59.470
Go ahead and try to force me
out of this girl!

09:01.110 --> 09:03.560
I beg of you!
Somebody please save my daughter!

09:03.560 --> 09:07.560
I will pay you anything if you can
rid my daughter of that demon!

09:07.560 --> 09:09.990
Two hundred million!
Five hundred million!

09:11.070 --> 09:12.990
Yawn

09:14.400 --> 09:16.450
Lick Lick Lick

09:20.330 --> 09:21.370
Namu

09:24.120 --> 09:26.120
Here I go! I'm gonna drink it!

09:26.930 --> 09:28.670
I'm getting bored of this.

09:28.900 --> 09:31.390
Your turn might be coming up soon.

09:30.630 --> 09:35.090
Winner

09:31.130 --> 09:35.090
49th out of 68

09:31.390 --> 09:32.960
Make sure you warm up a bit.

09:32.960 --> 09:35.090
You're making it sound like a workout.

09:35.820 --> 09:37.550
There are no warmups for this.

09:37.550 --> 09:46.020
Suikoden

09:38.070 --> 09:40.820
What's wrong, Dimple?
You're shaking like crazy.

09:40.820 --> 09:42.200
Are you a chihuahua?

09:42.200 --> 09:45.490
There's still time... Drop this job!

09:45.490 --> 09:46.020
Huh?

09:46.600 --> 09:50.480
I'm sure you've at least heard of
his name before... Mogami Keiji.

09:50.760 --> 09:52.000
Nope.

09:52.000 --> 09:52.940
Mogami...

09:53.440 --> 09:56.970
He's one of the people I referenced
when I first started in this biz.

09:56.970 --> 09:58.700
He's been dead for ages, though.

09:59.110 --> 10:01.280
We're talking about forty years ago!

10:01.280 --> 10:02.740
40 Years Ago

10:02.740 --> 10:04.240
Mogami Keiji

10:02.820 --> 10:04.240
Mogami Keiji.

10:04.240 --> 10:09.750
Mogami Keiji performs a seance

10:04.760 --> 10:10.240
He was known as a good psychic who used
seances and channeling to save people,

10:08.250 --> 10:13.710
Mogami Keiji

10:08.330 --> 10:13.710
The voices of the dead

10:10.240 --> 10:12.560
and the media loved him.

10:13.030 --> 10:17.300
But what the masses were seeing
was Mogami Keiji the entertainer.

10:16.300 --> 10:20.010
Psychic
Mogami Keiji

10:17.300 --> 10:19.550
And then one day,

10:19.550 --> 10:22.910
he completely vanished
from the public eye.

10:23.790 --> 10:26.140
Mogami had another side to him.

10:26.710 --> 10:29.350
He was an assassin
who used his powers to kill.

10:30.000 --> 10:31.810
Mogami was desperate for money.

10:32.320 --> 10:34.090
His mother was gravely ill,

10:34.090 --> 10:37.220
and the treatment and equipment
she needed cost a lot of money.

10:38.770 --> 10:43.990
Be it the living or the dead, seeing their
final moments had become routine for him.

10:43.990 --> 10:46.160
And it broke him.

10:47.650 --> 10:49.210
And that's around the time

10:49.410 --> 10:52.840
he showed up to exorcise me.

10:55.670 --> 10:57.800
How dare you do that to my followers?!

10:59.990 --> 11:02.410
I'm going full power for this!

11:05.450 --> 11:08.930
Overrun! Wraither Beam!

11:12.270 --> 11:13.020
I give up!

11:16.590 --> 11:19.890
Wait, I said I give up!
I won't do anything bad ever again!

11:19.890 --> 11:21.450
What are you talking about?

11:22.010 --> 11:24.490
You seem to have the wrong idea.

11:24.490 --> 11:27.330
I've come to absorb you.

11:27.550 --> 11:29.040
A-Absorb me?

11:29.840 --> 11:30.540
This bastard...

11:30.910 --> 11:34.040
He's human, but he's absorbing
my spiritual molecules!

11:34.570 --> 11:36.140
Are you trying to eat me?

11:36.140 --> 11:37.880
You'll just end up with an upset stomach!

11:38.470 --> 11:41.880
I am going to willfully
shuffle off this mortal coil soon

11:41.880 --> 11:43.840
and become a powerful vengeful spirit.

11:44.090 --> 11:46.000
Shit! This bastard's completely lost it!

11:46.440 --> 11:48.310
Wh-Why would you do that?

11:48.310 --> 11:50.190
Revenge.

11:50.190 --> 11:54.240
I'm going to show all those bastards who
think nothing bad will ever happen to them.

11:54.240 --> 11:57.130
Show them what true hatred is like.

11:57.130 --> 12:00.500
And what happens when they
manipulate and use someone.

12:00.850 --> 12:03.280
You're going to empower me
to achieve that goal.

12:06.240 --> 12:09.190
It appears I absorbed too many
vengeful spirits at once.

12:10.590 --> 12:11.960
It got away?

12:16.130 --> 12:17.420
Hang on a sec.

12:17.420 --> 12:20.130
What's that got to do with anything?

12:20.580 --> 12:22.700
That's Mogami himself!

12:22.700 --> 12:25.500
The star psychic of the 20th century,
Mogami Keiji!

12:25.500 --> 12:27.010
Or what's become of him.

12:29.360 --> 12:32.020
Please... spare... me...

12:32.300 --> 12:33.230
Goodbye.

12:38.770 --> 12:41.080
As I figured, this is all you're worth.

12:41.490 --> 12:42.930
You're all so weak,

12:43.280 --> 12:45.990
I have no reason to let you live!

12:45.990 --> 12:47.910
How sad.

12:47.910 --> 12:51.870
Apparently, it's finally my time to shine.

12:51.870 --> 12:55.120
It's a shame that I'm so bad
at rock-paper-scissors.

12:55.540 --> 12:59.670
Are you supposed to be a famous psychic?
I don't recognize you.

12:59.670 --> 13:02.520
Please... God...

13:02.880 --> 13:06.500
Begone... foul spirit!

13:06.880 --> 13:08.700
Jodo-sama's getting serious!

13:08.700 --> 13:09.850
This will be enlightening!

13:10.140 --> 13:13.560
He's not even bothering with chants
or throwing salt around, huh?

13:18.200 --> 13:19.070
Que?

13:21.410 --> 13:22.690
Hey, something's wrong.

13:22.690 --> 13:24.570
Did he get possessed?

13:25.010 --> 13:26.780
That's it?

13:27.090 --> 13:29.010
Hey, explain something to me.

13:29.010 --> 13:31.540
What makes this guy such a big shot?

13:33.780 --> 13:34.590
Here he comes.

13:34.590 --> 13:35.540
Run, Shigeo!

13:38.420 --> 13:40.790
Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike!

13:41.280 --> 13:46.060
A jumping knee strike to knock
a possessed person unconscious.

13:41.800 --> 13:48.760
Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike

13:46.060 --> 13:48.760
This is one of Reigen's special attacks.

13:48.760 --> 13:49.830
Jodo-sama!

13:49.830 --> 13:50.790
Sorry!

13:50.790 --> 13:52.100
Hey, evil spirit!

13:52.100 --> 13:54.730
If my intuition's correct,
you're actually Mogami Kei—

13:56.340 --> 13:58.270
You know who I am?

13:58.270 --> 14:00.310
Damn, it was true?!

14:00.870 --> 14:04.180
Why the hell are you possessing that girl?

14:04.180 --> 14:06.470
Were you into young girls
when you were alive—

14:06.470 --> 14:07.780
T-Time out...

14:08.660 --> 14:09.490
He's not stopping!

14:11.960 --> 14:12.700
Minori.

14:13.830 --> 14:15.290
Stop this.

14:15.290 --> 14:17.660
I'll stay by your side.

14:18.870 --> 14:21.090
Get awa...

14:30.160 --> 14:31.550
He impaled him!

14:32.230 --> 14:34.030
You can't... be serious...

14:36.080 --> 14:37.690
I didn't come here to see someone die!

14:37.690 --> 14:39.230
We can't deal with that monster!

14:39.230 --> 14:39.980
Run!

14:39.980 --> 14:41.720
I-It won't open?!

14:40.490 --> 14:41.720
No way!

14:41.720 --> 14:42.690
Let us out!

14:43.670 --> 14:46.150
Where do you think you're going?

14:47.180 --> 14:49.490
Well, this has gone to shit.

14:49.490 --> 14:52.290
Mob, you warmed up yet?

14:52.290 --> 14:52.870
Yes.

14:53.770 --> 14:55.680
Well, I'm not actually warmed up at all,

14:56.200 --> 14:58.260
but I know I have to deal with this anyway.

14:58.370 --> 15:00.500
Progress
Towards
Mob's
Explosion

15:00.500 --> 15:04.000
Mob Psycho

15:04.000 --> 15:07.510
Mob Psycho

15:08.160 --> 15:09.560
A demon...

15:09.560 --> 15:11.470
Shouldn't we run away?

15:12.720 --> 15:15.140
I'm pretty confident in my abilities.

15:18.930 --> 15:19.770
Spirit Hold!

15:26.920 --> 15:28.130
Oh?

15:28.130 --> 15:31.570
I don't know who it is, but someone's
got some decent telekinetic powers.

15:32.290 --> 15:37.270
It's true that humans can't move
their joints past a certain point.

15:37.740 --> 15:40.520
But what about a doll's joints?

15:43.870 --> 15:45.710
Oh, look. I can move.

15:47.250 --> 15:48.990
That girl's body...

15:52.230 --> 15:53.430
Get it now?

15:54.060 --> 15:57.430
Nothing you do to this body will affect me.
It's not a solution.

15:58.860 --> 16:01.890
What are you laughing about?

16:02.420 --> 16:03.350
It's him.

16:03.830 --> 16:05.400
There is a solution.

16:08.040 --> 16:10.820
I'll make you disappear.

16:13.500 --> 16:14.660
Now we're talking!

16:14.960 --> 16:16.280
Such incredible spiritual power...

16:18.910 --> 16:20.200
What the hell is that?

16:20.200 --> 16:21.550
I've never seen anything like it!

16:23.310 --> 16:25.380
Get out of Minori-san... Now!

16:31.420 --> 16:32.890
Amazing...

16:32.890 --> 16:34.340
I thought he was just some kid,

16:34.340 --> 16:35.960
but he's insanely powerful!

16:38.060 --> 16:41.180
Forget being possessed!
They're fusing into one now!

16:41.970 --> 16:43.690
I messed up...

16:44.460 --> 16:48.410
Master, the situation's gotten even worse.

16:48.410 --> 16:50.280
You're telling me he's
stronger than you, Mob?

16:50.280 --> 16:51.280
Yes.

16:51.680 --> 16:53.060
No way...

16:53.060 --> 16:56.160
That bastard... He's even livelier now
than when he was alive!

16:58.130 --> 16:59.620
You done, kid?

17:01.860 --> 17:02.830
Now's our only chance!

17:05.820 --> 17:07.820
That bastard actually did it.

17:07.820 --> 17:10.650
He became the most powerful evil spirit...

17:10.650 --> 17:14.490
Well, if you die and can't pass on,
at least we'll have each other.

17:14.490 --> 17:16.000
Don't even joke about that!

17:16.000 --> 17:17.040
I see.

17:17.880 --> 17:21.560
I can go inside of Minori-san
and expel the evil spirit from within.

17:21.560 --> 17:22.900
Are you stupid?!

17:22.900 --> 17:26.810
How's a human like you going
to enter another human?!

17:27.420 --> 17:28.970
With an out of body experience.

17:29.750 --> 17:31.550
I see...

17:31.550 --> 17:34.770
But during that time, your body
will be completely defenseless.

17:34.770 --> 17:38.950
Not to mention her body will resist you!

17:39.490 --> 17:41.440
But I have no other choice.

17:41.810 --> 17:46.420
Dimple, could you possess my body
for a while and protect it?

17:46.640 --> 17:47.370
Say what?

17:47.560 --> 17:50.480
No, no! Anything but that, Mob!

17:50.480 --> 17:52.340
If you let him in,
he'll probably never leave.

17:52.710 --> 17:55.300
You know what you're signing up for, right?

17:57.820 --> 18:00.220
Are you seriously going to trust Dimple?

18:00.220 --> 18:01.810
I'm sure it'll be fine.

18:04.460 --> 18:06.570
First, I need to lose consciousness.

18:07.470 --> 18:08.730
Concentrate...

18:09.130 --> 18:11.840
Has he changed a little?

18:11.840 --> 18:14.990
Or wait... Is he trying to change himself?

18:16.240 --> 18:17.240
Whoa!

18:18.650 --> 18:20.950
Holy shit! Even I can see it!

18:24.600 --> 18:25.540
He's coming!

18:25.740 --> 18:26.750
Take that!

18:28.120 --> 18:29.090
Wait a sec!

18:35.070 --> 18:36.970
It's no use... I can't move.

18:37.400 --> 18:41.430
If you don't need this body anymore,
why don't I take it off your hands?

18:43.330 --> 18:44.600
You dumbass.

18:45.210 --> 18:47.060
It belongs to me now!

18:47.290 --> 18:49.020
That's what you get!

18:50.390 --> 18:51.320
Whoa there!

18:51.320 --> 18:55.150
I'm not gonna let you break
my precious body that easily!

18:58.630 --> 19:02.200
Why's there another spirit?
What a nuisance.

19:02.430 --> 19:03.410
Begone.

19:03.840 --> 19:05.200
Now, Shigeo!

19:08.410 --> 19:10.220
So that's your game...

19:10.220 --> 19:11.880
You must be insane.

19:12.120 --> 19:14.840
Yeah, he's not a normal kid.

19:18.990 --> 19:20.030
Go...

19:20.660 --> 19:23.560
I know you can... win...

19:26.450 --> 19:27.680
Welcome.

19:28.180 --> 19:30.410
Is your sense of self still intact?

19:30.410 --> 19:34.230
If you'd made one misstep getting in here,
your soul would've been destroyed.

19:34.880 --> 19:36.690
Please leave this body.

19:36.890 --> 19:39.290
You didn't come here to talk, did you?

19:39.290 --> 19:42.800
Correct, but you seem so human.

19:42.800 --> 19:45.130
We're currently in a mental world.

19:45.130 --> 19:47.910
It mirrors the way we see ourselves.

19:48.350 --> 19:51.960
I'm Mogami Keiji, a former psychic.

19:52.500 --> 19:54.660
How about we have a little contest?

20:00.230 --> 20:01.250
A barrier, eh?

20:01.400 --> 20:03.370
Very impressive.

20:03.370 --> 20:05.390
Mind showing me a little more?

20:08.820 --> 20:10.810
He's got his evil spirit face on now.

20:15.480 --> 20:17.090
Such power...

20:23.340 --> 20:27.160
You've truly been blessed...
with incredible power...

20:27.760 --> 20:31.120
That's a ghost... An evil spirit...

20:31.480 --> 20:33.480
By the way, young man...

20:33.820 --> 20:38.660
Do you know where spiritual
power or ESP comes from?

20:38.660 --> 20:41.130
Sorry, but I don't have any more time.

20:41.130 --> 20:42.130
I'm going to finish you now.

20:42.430 --> 20:43.850
Your emotions.

20:43.850 --> 20:46.050
It all comes from your emotions.

20:49.640 --> 20:53.750
The biggest distinguishing feature of humans
is how rich and varied their emotions are.

20:53.750 --> 20:57.700
These emotions are the reason they thrive
and also the reason they fight.

20:58.080 --> 21:00.050
Huh? My powers...

21:00.050 --> 21:02.990
You can't use ESP anymore.

21:02.990 --> 21:06.760
I was gauging how you
picture your powers earlier.

21:07.200 --> 21:09.030
Quite impressive.

21:09.030 --> 21:11.700
All kinds of emotions
are raging inside of you.

21:11.700 --> 21:14.800
But for some reason,
you willingly play the part of a puppet.

21:14.800 --> 21:16.280
Please... leave...

21:16.280 --> 21:19.830
You still don't get the fact
that you fell into a trap?

21:19.830 --> 21:22.570
I let you in on purpose.

21:24.120 --> 21:26.300
Now, here's the million-dollar question.

21:26.300 --> 21:30.420
People whose lives are filled with happiness,
and people who live in eternal suffering...

21:30.420 --> 21:33.640
Which do you think harbor
strong emotions more easily?

21:33.910 --> 21:35.840
The answer is the latter.

21:35.840 --> 21:38.400
Negative feelings are much more powerful.

21:38.730 --> 21:43.360
The more stressed someone is,
the richer the energy they hold within.

21:43.830 --> 21:48.660
Going by that, there's room for
more drastic change in you.

21:49.430 --> 21:52.620
All you need is a slight change
in how you see the world.

21:53.100 --> 21:54.740
Want me to help you out?

22:00.580 --> 22:02.090
It's morning...

22:03.180 --> 22:05.350
Kageyama Shigeo.

22:05.350 --> 22:07.220
Here, you're a normal middle schooler.

22:08.000 --> 22:12.350
I altered your memories a bit,
and made it so you can't use ESP.

22:13.640 --> 22:16.980
A change in perspective can make
the world a whole different place.

22:17.260 --> 22:22.620
With that in mind, I'll be observing
how you act without your powers.

23:55.920 --> 23:58.700
Huh? What was I doing again?

23:58.920 --> 24:00.120
I was doing something important...

24:00.990 --> 24:02.670
But I can't remember it at all.

24:03.220 --> 24:05.390
Oh, I should hurry up and get to school.

24:05.920 --> 24:08.460
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 II Episode 5:

24:08.460 --> 24:10.300
Discord
~Choices~

24:08.640 --> 24:10.190
"Discord ~Choices~."
